egin{aligned}\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{2\\cancel{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}\\cdot \\frac{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }=\\frac{1}{2}\n$$" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275518 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275519 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275520 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275521 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275522 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1041 "selection" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275519 13194139533975 true] [17592186275517 1110 #uuid "16a60b5c-2f1d-52ea-95bd-c17067be0748" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275518 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275518 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533975 true] [17592186275518 1111 #uuid "9360363d-517d-58d7-8777-7d3a0ce4358b" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275519 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275519 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533975 true] [17592186275519 1111 #uuid "9388ad1b-ecc3-52f9-b7bd-b65e265412e0" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275520 1034 "1" 13194139533975 true] [17592186275520 1103 #edb/ref